# The TAG section and the list of one tag ("Tag: Blu").
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/tag.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Tab
Down 14
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
